846 0 obj
  << /ActualText (EXPERIENCE \n\nCapstone Leader \nLed the development of a research\055based community geo\055tagging mobile application for reporting highway issues such as potholes and road hazards\056 Directed system design\054 feature planning\054 and implementation of smart reporting and route optimization features\056 Conducted gorilla testing with a 92\045 positive user feedback and secured successful client acceptance during evaluation\056\n\nUI\046UX Designer \050Freelance\051\nDesigned user\055centered web and mobile interfaces with a focus on usability\054 accessibility\054 and visual consistency\056 Collaborated with clients to craft engaging digital experiences and consistently delivered projects on time with a 95\045 customer satisfaction rate\056\n\nUI\057UX Designer Intern\nContributed to the design of user\055centered interfaces by applying UI\057UX principles and user\055focused thinking in real\055world projects\056 Enhanced problem\055solving and design accuracy while improving digital experiences\054 resulting in a notable improvement in design efficiency and technical skills within 2 weeks of intensive practice\056\n\nAI Video Annotator\nAnnotated and labeled video datasets to support AI and machine learning model training\056 Performed object tracking\054 activity labeling\054 and data validation while adhering to strict annotation guidelines and quality standards\056 Achieved a 100\045 accuracy score based on QA validation and quality checks\056\n\nAcademic Mentoring Secretary\054 Social Media Officer\nCoordinated academic mentoring programs by organizing activities\054 managing documentation\054 and facilitating communication between mentors and students\056 Led social media efforts by creating content and increasing page engagement and reach by 64\045\056\n\nLead Generation Specialist\nSourced and verified email contacts for educational institutions\054 targeting key decision\055makers such as school administrators and department heads\056 Maintained up to 95\045 data accuracy through rigorous research and validation\054 producing clean and structured lead lists for outreach\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 847 0 R
